JAALAYI SHAM E AZA AYATOU KE SAAYE ME<br>
<br>
1.Aseer Hoke Haram Karbala Se Jabke Chale<br>
Madad Ke Waste Abass They Na Akber They<br>
Sitam Aseeri Ki Zindan Me Subh o Shaam Sahe<br>
Rehai Qaid Se Paate Hi Binte Hyder Ne<br>
Jalayi Sham e Aza Ayatou Ke Saaye Me<br>
<br>
2.Sitam Aseerou Ka Ehsas Bangayi Zainab<br>
Aza Ke Qafale Ki Aas Bangayi Zainab<br>
Padha Jo Waqt Toh Abbas Bangayi Zainab<br>
Alam Ku Uncha Rakha Aayatou Ke Saye Me<br>
<br>
3.Tadhap Ke Bhai Ke Chehre Ku Ek Nazar Dekha<br>
Ghamou Se Chur Shaheedou Ku Sar Ba Sar Dekha<br>
Jo Apne Bachou Ki Laashou Ku Khoon Me Tar Dekkha<br>
Kiya Hai Shukre Khuda Aayatou Ke Saye Me<br>
<br>
4.Sakina Mar Ke Bhi Zindan Se Reha Na Howi<br>
Yateem Bachi Pe Wo Koun Si Jaafa Na Howi<br>
Aseeri Abid e Bemaar Se Juda Na Howi<br>
Behan Ku Dafan Kiya Aayatou Ke Saye Me<br>
<br>
5.Sarapa Aayath e Tatheer Bangayi Zainab<br>
Kabhi Hasan Kabhi Shabbir Bangayi Zainab<br>
Ali Ki Bolti Tasweer Bangayi Zainab<br>
Jihad e Sabr Kiya Aayatou Ke Saye Me<br>
<br>
6.Numaya Parde Na Unwan Kargayi Zainab<br>
Khuda ke Deen Pe Ehsan Kargayi Zainab<br>
Rida ke Lafz Ku Quran Kargayi Zainab<br>
Cheeni Jo Sar Se Rida Aayatou Ke Saye Me<br>
<br>
7.Hamara Matam o Girya Qubool Hojaye<br>
Hamare Ashkou ka Tohfa Qubool Hojaye<br>
Yeh Pursa Fatima Zehra Qubool Hojaye<br>
Karo Yeh Milke Dua Aayatou Ke Saye me<br>
<br>
8.Dia Hai Ghum Ka Yeh Phuke se Phuk Nahin Sakta<br>
Kisi Ke Ruke Se Matam Yeh Rukh Nahin Sakta<br>
Hasan Alam Yeh Kisi Haal Jukh Nahin Sakta<br>
Hai Karwan e Aza Aayatou Ke Saye Me
